  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have learned to weave a spellmark charge into a construct of web.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Spellmark Reservoir Species Feature.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your spellmark charges may be used to create web constructs that function similarly to scrolls. You must ingest special dietary materials to do so that cost 75% of the crafting price of a scroll for the current stored spell charge you wish to weave. Woven spellmarks require a +10 to the DC to learn for non-veryx casters as that the three dimensional pattern must be transcribed into a flat format.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/veryx#toc36\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
